# Government School Management System - System Architecture & Database Schema

## 1. System Overview
A Laravel 12 based enterprise application designed specifically for government schools. It follows a clean architecture using the Repository Pattern and Service Layer for scalability and testability.

## 2. Database Schema (ERD Logic)

### Core Tables

#### `users`
- id (PK)
- name, email, password
- role_id (FK)
- school_id (FK, nullable for Super Admin)
- status (active/inactive)

#### `schools`
- id (PK)
- code (Government School Code)
- name, address, district, tehsil
- principal_name, phone_number
- logo_path

#### `students`
- id (PK)
- admission_no (Unique)
- first_name, last_name, gender, dob
- b_form_number (National ID)
- religion, blood_group, photo_path
- father_name, father_cnic, mobile_number
- current_class_id (FK), current_section_id (FK)
- status (Regular, Transferred, Graduated)

#### `teachers`
- id (PK)
- employee_number (Unique)
- full_name, cnic, mobile, email
- qualification, specialization, experience
- user_id (FK)

#### `classes` & `sections`
- `classes`: id, name (Primary, Middle, High, etc.)
- `sections`: id, class_id (FK), name (A, B, C)

#### `subjects`
- id, name, code, class_id (FK)

#### `attendance`
- id, student_id (FK), date, status (P, A, L), marked_by (FK: user_id)

#### `exams` & `marks`
- `exam_types`: id, name (Midterm, Annual)
- `exam_schedules`: id, exam_type_id (FK), class_id (FK), subject_id (FK), date
- `marks`: id, student_id (FK), subject_id (FK), exam_type_id (FK), marks_obtained, total_marks, remarks

### 3. Key Relationships
- **School Has Many** Students, Teachers, Classes.
- **Class Has Many** Sections, Subjects.
- **Teacher Has Many** Subject Assignments, Class Assignments.
- **Student Has Many** Attendance Records, Marks.

## 4. Laravel Implementation Details
- **Controllers**: Handled via Resource Controllers (StudentController, TeacherController).
- **Repositories**: StudentRepository, AttendanceRepository to decouple DB logic.
- **Services**: AttendanceService (logic for alerts), ExaminationService (logic for result generation).
- **Middleware**: `CheckRole` to handle Super Admin, School Admin, Teacher, Student, Parent access.
- **Policies**: `StudentPolicy` to ensure teachers can only mark marks for their assigned classes.
